              "value": 7
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You call upon your deity to grant you their protective blessing. Attempt a DC 30 Religion check. If you have legendary proficiency in Religion, you can instead attempt a DC 40 Religion check to increase the temporary Hit Points you gain on a successful check to 15 (25 on a critical success).\n\n- **Critical Success:** You gain 10 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.\n- **Success:** You gain 5 temporary Hit Points. You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** Your deity withholds their blessing. You cannot attempt to call to your deity again for 1 day."
            }
          }
